msgctxt "01_02N01"
msgid "I will personally see that it is on the next plane."
msgstr "Jag ska personligen se till att det kommer med nästa flygplan."

msgctxt "01_03P01"
msgid "Eh, perhaps not."
msgstr "Eh, kanske inte."

msgctxt "01_04P01"
msgid "I see."
msgstr "Jag förstår."

msgctxt "01_09N01"
msgid "Help a poor soul."
msgstr "Hjälp en stackars själ."

msgctxt "01_09N02"
msgid "Help a poor soul."
msgstr "Hjälp en stackars själ."

msgctxt "01_09N03"
msgid "Help a poor soul."
msgstr "Hjälp en stackars själ."

msgctxt "01_09N04"
msgid "Help a poor soul."
msgstr "Hjälp en stackars själ."

msgctxt "01_09N05"
msgid "Help a poor soul."
msgstr "Hjälp en stackars själ."

msgctxt "01_09P01"
msgid "Do you speak English?"
msgstr "Talar ni engelska?"

msgctxt "01_09P02"
msgid "You don't happen to have a pass to the Hall of Classics, do you?"
msgstr "Du har väl inte ett pass till Klassikernas sal?"

msgctxt "01_09P03"
msgid "Are you the blacksmith?"
msgstr "Är ni smeden?"

msgctxt "01_09P04"
msgid "Do you know when the blacksmith opens?"
msgstr "Vet ni när smeden öppnar?"

msgctxt "01_09P05"
msgid ""
"I don't suppose you have a pass to get through that archway at the end of "
"the street, do you?"
msgstr ""
"Ni har väl inte ett pass för att komma genom den där valvbågen i slutet av "
"gatan?"

msgctxt "01_09P06"
msgid "That old amulet. Could I buy it?"
msgstr "Den där gamla amuletten. Kan jag få köpa den?"

msgctxt "01_09P07"
msgid "Perhaps I'll talk to you later, if I may."
msgstr "Kanske pratar jag med er senare, om jag får."

msgctxt "01_10P01"
msgid "It was worth a try."
msgstr "Det var värt ett försök."

msgctxt "02_02P01"
msgid "What a beautiful day!"
msgstr "Vilken vacker dag!"

msgctxt "02_02P02"
msgid "Do you speak English?"
msgstr "Talar ni engelska?"

msgctxt "02_02P03"
msgid "You don't happen to have a pass to the Hall of Classics, do you?"
msgstr "Du har väl inte ett pass till Klassikernas sal?"

msgctxt "02_03P04"
msgid "May I ask how you came by that helmet, madam?"
msgstr "Får jag fråga hur ni fick tag i den där hjälmen, madam?"

msgctxt "02N01"
msgid "You must have a pass."
msgstr "Du måste ha ett pass."

msgctxt "03_02N01"
msgid "You must have a pass."
msgstr "Du måste ha ett pass."

msgctxt "03_02N02"
msgid "I do not have passes. I examine passes."
msgstr "Jag har inga pass. Jag kontrollerar pass."

msgctxt "03_02P01"
msgid "I'd like to go through there."
msgstr "Jag vill gå igenom där."

msgctxt "03_02P02"
msgid "You don't happen to have a pass to the Hall of Classics, do you?"
msgstr "Du har väl inte ett pass till Klassikernas sal?"

msgctxt "03_03P01"
msgid "And a fine job you're doing, too."
msgstr "Och ni gör ett utmärkt arbete också."

msgctxt "03_06N02"
msgid "Through there."
msgstr "Där igenom."

msgctxt "03_06P02"
msgid "Where do I get a pass?"
msgstr "Var får jag ett pass?"

msgctxt "03_07P03"
msgid ""
"Thanks. I couldn't believe that's what you said. I needed to hear it again."
msgstr ""
"Tack. Jag kunde inte tro att det var det ni sa. Jag behövde höra det igen."

msgctxt "04_01N01"
msgid "And now, Mr. Ripley. Where will you be traveling?"
msgstr "Och nu, herr Ripley. Vart ska ni resa?"

msgctxt "04_01N05"
msgid "Goodbye, Mr. Ripley. Goodbye, Mi-chan."
msgstr "Farväl, herr Ripley. Farväl, Mi-chan."

msgctxt "04_01N06"
msgid "See you again, Mr. Ripley."
msgstr "Vi ses igen, herr Ripley."

msgctxt "04_01P01"
msgid "I'd like to book passage."
msgstr "Jag vill boka en resa."

msgctxt "04_01P02"
msgid "I'd like to send a parcel to New York."
msgstr "Jag vill skicka ett paket till New York."

msgctxt "04_01P03"
msgid "I'd like to withdraw the money in my account."
msgstr "Jag vill ta ut pengarna på mitt konto."

msgctxt "04_01P04"
msgid "I'd like to buy some yuan."
msgstr "Jag vill köpa yuan."

msgctxt "04_01P05"
msgid "Thanks, Qian Shu! Goodbye!"
msgstr "Tack, Qian Shu! Farväl!"

msgctxt "04_02N01"
msgid "I will personally see that it is on the next plane."
msgstr "Jag ska personligen se till att det kommer med nästa flygplan."

msgctxt "04_03N01"
msgid "Thank you, Mr. Ripley. Please sign here."
msgstr "Tack, herr Ripley. Skriv under här, tack."

msgctxt "04_04N01"
msgid "I'm sorry Mr. Ripley, your account is empty."
msgstr "Jag beklagar, herr Ripley, ert konto är tomt."

msgctxt "04_06N01"
msgid "And now, Mr. Ripley, when will you be ready to leave?"
msgstr "Och nu, herr Ripley, när är ni redo att resa?"

msgctxt "04_06P01"
msgid "New York."
msgstr "New York."

msgctxt "04_07P02"
msgid "Danzig."
msgstr "Danzig."

msgctxt "04_08P03"
msgid "SIKIM"
msgstr "SIKIM"

msgctxt "04_08P04"
msgid "Peru."
msgstr "Peru."

msgctxt "04_09P01"
msgid "NOW!"
msgstr "NU!"

msgctxt "04_09P02"
msgid "I'll let you know."
msgstr "Jag meddelar er."

msgctxt "04_11N01"
msgid ""
"Huh, Mr. Ripley, I cannot find any money in your account. Could pause "
"expects have made some error, or will you be paying in cash?"
msgstr ""
"Hm, herr Ripley, jag kan inte hitta några pengar på ert konto. Jag måste ha "
"gjort något fel, eller tänker ni betala kontant?"

msgctxt "04_11P02"
msgid "Of course, of course."
msgstr "Javisst."

msgctxt "04_12N01"
msgid ""
"Mr. Ripley, as I said, my records show no money in your account. Would you "
"prefer to pay in cash?"
msgstr ""
"Herr Ripley, som jag sa visar mina register inga pengar på ert konto. "
"Föredrar ni att betala kontant?"
